"Earnings Withholding Order | California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/jcc-form/WG-002)\nciteturn2024search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; # Earnings Withholding Order (WG-002) ... This sheriff, marshal, or constable may prepare this form or ask you to prepare it for them. ... Effective: January 1, 2026\n\n# Earnings Withholding Order (WG-002)\n\nTells the employer (orders) to garnish wages of an employee. This sheriff, marshal, or constable may prepare this form or ask you to prepare it for them.\n\nGet form WG-002\n\n  * 汉语Get form WG-002 in Chinese Simplified (Chinese Simplified)\n  * 한국어Get form WG-002 in Korean (Korean)\n  * españolGet form WG-002 in Spanish (Spanish)\n  * Tiếng ViệtGet form WG-002 in Vietnamese (Vietnamese)\n\nEffective: January 1, 2026\n\n  * Go to How-to instructions for Debt Collection--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nJUDICIAL COUNCIL FORMS (https://courts.ca.gov/system/files?file=rules-court%2Fappendix_0.pdf)\nciteturn2024search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: last month; WG-002* | 1/1/2026 | Earnings Withholding Order\nJUDICIAL COUNCIL FORMS\n\nForm number | Effective date | Form title | [Rev. July 21, 2026]\n---|---|---|---\nVL-120 | 9/1/2018 | Application for Order to Vacate Prefiling Order and Remove Plaintiff/Petitioner From Judicial Council Vexatious Litigant List |\nVL-125 | 9/1/2018 | Order on Application to Vacate Prefiling Order and Remove Plaintiff/Petitioner From Judicial Council Vexatious Litigant List |\n\nWage Garnishment\n\nForm number | Effective date | Form title\n---|---|---\nWG-001* | 1/1/2012 | Application For Earnings Withholding Order\nWG-002* | 1/1/2026 | Earnings Withholding Order\nWG-002 C | 1/1/2026 | Earnings Withholding Order (Chinese)\nWG-002 K | 1/1/2026 | Earnings Withholding Order (Korean)\nWG-002 S | 1/1/2026 | Earnings Withholding Order (Spanish)\nWG-002 V | 1/1/2026 | Earnings Withholding Order (Vietnamese)\nWG-003* | 1/1/2